{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Streamers can safely use all in-game music \u2014 no copyright issues!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wake up from your lucid dream!!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy an ODD journey to wake up from your Lucid dream!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795230/extras/smile.gif?t=1744600225\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A fast-paced Crazy action shooting rogue-lite FPS with a challenging difficulty level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795230/extras/GIF_1.gif?t=1744600225\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world far from reality was created by combining the mind of the protagonist who usually liked games, \u2018ODDroom\u2019.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795230/extras/fevertime.gif?t=1744600225\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795230/extras/GIF_2.gif?t=1744600225\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can bring Catcoins to dream cats interested in money and you can grow.\u00a0 (Money is important even in dreams).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of ODD rooms with different styles and difficulties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795230/extras/GIF_3.gif?t=1744600225\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of ODD Weapons, from ordinary to strange, and very strange.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ODD Skills that allow you to fly and fight in your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795230/extras/GIF_4.gif?t=1744600225\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ODD Monsters, from ordinary to strange.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795230/extras/GIF_5.gif?t=1744600225\" /></p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Room 001 Clear ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2795230/aff53619fe54b9a6def91cd2e1401b9097b4c210.jpg"},{"name":"Room 002 Clear ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2795230/d7fae991854525ccc23e38232e3f7de96fc7197d.jpg"},{"name":"Room 003 Clear ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2795230/219eb9649a186bed89e54401fbddbc2411d06997.jpg"},{"name":"Room 004 Clear ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2795230/78283b47705f3949bedd86abba98341e8a478f07.jpg"},{"name":"Room 005 Clear ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2795230/3e5edee8162c39cc5bf9f6f9f8d9926e79fa5baf.jpg"},{"name":"Room 006 Clear ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2795230/6f1a565efacadeccd45c125bb4b99e27c4a70f4c.jpg"},{"name":"Room 007 Clear ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2795230/edf08b6ba62e0d1fa8383ad5b79967759dc66212.jpg"},{"name":"Room 008 Clear ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2795230/0e634f0334f50b013a36ea5231ec9a1943a05d41.jpg"},{"name":"Room 009 Clear ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2795230/f8edc3490e69243d9323203967d997dbfc9b291c.jpg"},{"name":"Room 010 Clear ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2795230/717262fcb67a643c778828ab64973b9153e39195.jpg"}],"total":19},"background"